From 1eaf81b66aacf1205b2775203cff6d2ba538c573 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kudriavuy <169286443+kudriavuy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:06:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Browser tabs panel

Command = "Tabs" opens a panel over the program's part of the row: a
close button, a new-tab key (Ctrl+T) and the browser's tabs (icon and
title, the active one - by the window title - lighter) in a row that
scrolls and runs on after a flick, like the emoji row (now both use
scroll.rs). The helper lists the tabs from plasma-browser-integration
("tabs refresh" on opening and on every title change while open) into
.../tabs and .../tab-<id>.png; a tapped tab is "tab <id>" to it.

Upstream: https://github.com/AsahiLinux/tiny-dfr (applies to 285faff8b8cae893e9babd673b904929dd6f7f9c)
